---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE_TITLE, SITE_URL } from '../consts';

const lastUpdated = new Date('2026-01-01');
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`Privacy Policy — ${SITE_TITLE}`}
  description="TechAudit privacy policy — how we collect, use, and protect your data."
>
  <div class="legal-page">
    <div class="legal-hero">
      <div class="container">
        <span class="mono-tag">// LEGAL</span>
        <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p class="legal-meta">
          <span>Effective: January 1, 2026</span>
          <span>Last Updated: {lastUpdated.toLocaleDateString('en-US', { year: 'numeric', month: 'long', day: 'numeric' })}</span>
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="container legal-body">
      <article class="prose legal-content">
        <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
        <p>TechAudit ("we," "our," or "us") operates the website located at {SITE_URL} (the "Site"). We collect information to provide and improve our service to you.</p>

        <h3>1.1 Information You Provide</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Contact Form:</strong> Name, email address, and message content when you contact us.</li>
          <li><strong>Newsletter Subscriptions:</strong> Email address when you subscribe to our newsletter.</li>
        </ul>

        <h3>1.2 Automatically Collected Information</h3>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Server Logs:</strong> IP addresses, browser type, pages viewed, and referring URLs.</li>
          <li><strong>Cookies:</strong> We use minimal cookies for site functionality. No third-party tracking cookies are set.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
        <p>We use collected information to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Respond to your inquiries and messages</li>
          <li>Send newsletters and editorial updates (only if subscribed)</li>
          <li>Analyze site usage to improve content and performance</li>
          <li>Comply with legal obligations</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>3. Data Sharing</h2>
        <p>We do not sell, trade, or rent your personal information to third parties. We may share data with:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Service Providers:</strong> Hosting, email delivery, and analytics providers who process data on our behalf under strict confidentiality agreements.</li>
          <li><strong>Legal Requirements:</strong> When required by law, court order, or government authority.</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>4. Security</h2>
        <p>We implement industry-standard security measures including HTTPS/TLS encryption, strict Content Security Policy headers, and regular security audits. No data transmission over the internet is 100% secure; we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>

        <h2>5. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>Contact form submissions are retained for 90 days. Newsletter subscriber data is retained until unsubscription. Server logs are retained for 30 days.</p>

        <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
        <p>Depending on your jurisdiction, you may have rights to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Access personal data we hold about you</li>
          <li>Request correction of inaccurate data</li>
          <li>Request deletion of your data</li>
          <li>Object to processing of your data</li>
          <li>Data portability</li>
        </ul>
        <p>To exercise these rights, contact us at the address below.</p>

        <h2>7. Cookies</h2>
        <p>This site uses only functional cookies necessary for site operation. We do not use advertising or tracking cookies. You can configure your browser to refuse all cookies.</p>

        <h2>8. Children's Privacy</h2>
        <p>Our site is not directed to children under 13. We do not knowingly collect personal information from children.</p>

        <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
        <p>We may update this policy periodically. Changes will be posted on this page with an updated "Last Updated" date. Continued use of the site after changes constitutes acceptance.</p>

        <h2>10. Contact</h2>
        <p>For privacy inquiries or to exercise your rights, contact us at:</p>
        <p>
          <strong>TechAudit</strong><br />
          Website: <a href={SITE_URL}>{SITE_URL}</a><br />
          Contact form: <a href="/contact">techaudit.in/contact/</a>
        </p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .legal-hero {
    background: var(--surface);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border2);
    padding: 3rem 0 2rem;
    position: relative;
  }

  .legal-hero::before {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
    height: 2px;
    background: var(--neon);
  }

  .mono-tag {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--neon);
    display: block;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .legal-hero h1 {
    font-family: var(--display);
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.5rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .legal-meta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 2rem;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--dim);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .legal-body {
    padding: 3rem 0 5rem;
  }

  .legal-content {
    max-width: 760px;
  }
</style>
